      "text": "containers - allow you to run software on your machine without \"installing it\"\n    - runs inside a runtime (Container runtime)\n    - pretty safe - can't access resources on your machine, etc. unless you give it permission.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "containers - allow you to run software on your machine without \"installing it\"\n    - runs inside a runtime (Container runtime)\n    - pretty safe - can't access resources on your machine, etc. unless you give it permission.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
